{"unit_id":"linzimu666__dsh-intent-suggest#card-zh","repo":"linzimu666/dsh-intent-suggest","commit":"1f7425fbe979724ce61d6f7443cbeae89d9644cd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-intent-suggest 是面向 DSH Web 的输入建议插件，会在对话输入框附近根据正在输入的片段和最近对话生成最多三条不同方向的可执行任务候选。它通过 DSH 模型服务流式取得结果，支持编程、调研和自定义画像，并过滤不相关或重复的候选、尽量保持显示位置稳定。点击候选只会填回输入框，发送仍由用户决定；适合希望更快组织代码任务或调研请求的 DSH 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.src.js:241-349","engine/suggest.js:19-46"]}
{"unit_id":"linzimu666__dsh-intent-suggest#card-en","repo":"linzimu666/dsh-intent-suggest","commit":"1f7425fbe979724ce61d6f7443cbeae89d9644cd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-intent-suggest is a DSH Web assistant that uses drafts and recent conversation to suggest up to three actionable tasks. It streams through DSH models, supports development, research, and custom personas, and filters duplicates. Selecting a suggestion fills the input without sending it.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.src.js:241-349","engine/suggest.js:19-46"]}
