{"unit_id":"linzimu666__dsh-intent-suggest#feature-draft","repo":"linzimu666/dsh-intent-suggest","commit":"1f7425fbe979724ce61d6f7443cbeae89d9644cd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-intent-suggest 的功能「根据输入生成任务候选」：用户在输入框输入至少两个字符并停笔后，插件结合最近对话请求模型生成最多三条不同方向的可执行任务；完成句子的等待时间较短。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.src.js:12-17","client.src.js:204-235","engine/prompt.js:176-186"]}
{"unit_id":"linzimu666__dsh-intent-suggest#feature-context","repo":"linzimu666/dsh-intent-suggest","commit":"1f7425fbe979724ce61d6f7443cbeae89d9644cd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-intent-suggest 的功能「结合会话上下文」：插件读取当前会话最近六轮用户与助手文本，并截断较长轮次，再与当前输入一起提供给意图生成流程，以帮助解释简短指代。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:5-27","engine/prompt.js:120-130"]}
{"unit_id":"linzimu666__dsh-intent-suggest#feature-persona","repo":"linzimu666/dsh-intent-suggest","commit":"1f7425fbe979724ce61d6f7443cbeae89d9644cd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-intent-suggest 的功能「切换建议画像」：输入框建议栏可在编程、调研和自定义画像间切换；自定义画像由用户描述生成提示词和方向列表，并保存到浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.src.js:18-54","client.src.js:241-269","engine/suggest.js:80-97"]}
{"unit_id":"linzimu666__dsh-intent-suggest#feature-pick","repo":"linzimu666/dsh-intent-suggest","commit":"1f7425fbe979724ce61d6f7443cbeae89d9644cd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-intent-suggest 的功能「选择并填入候选」：候选按意图方向显示为按钮；点击后只把任务文本写回 DSH 输入框，不会自动发送，候选会去重并尽量保持原有位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.src.js:97-109","client.src.js:277-279","engine/stability.js:31-59"]}
{"unit_id":"linzimu666__dsh-intent-suggest#caveat-local-api","repo":"linzimu666/dsh-intent-suggest","commit":"1f7425fbe979724ce61d6f7443cbeae89d9644cd","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-intent-suggest 使用 DSH 宿主提供的同源接口转发模型请求，并注册建议、上下文和 provider 查询接口；宿主代码对请求做来源检查。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:136-198"]}
